Chrome Pixel Art Studio
Original source: https://github.com/GoogleChromeLabs/webmcp-tools/tree/main/demos/pixel-art-studio
Upstream commit: 24cb5cb0d4b6609aac5426f90a5de6ddb847bdeb
Copyright 2026 Google LLC. Licensed under Apache-2.0.

Modifications: MCP Apps launch wrapper and endpoint, compact widget layout,
manual artwork controls disabled, bundled Latin fonts, native iframe tests.
Original drawing tools and handlers are preserved.

Pixel Art Studio v1.1 adds app-side MCP Apps tool discovery and calls, sharing
the original WebMCP handlers, schema validation, readiness gating, and bridge tests.

Maze v3 adds the shared app-side tool bridge, a fixed six-tool embedded
surface, readiness and game-state guards, status text, and host solve/replay tests.
The standalone maze retains the original state-dependent native tool lifecycle.

WebMCP-only ports (Maze v4, Pixel Art v2) remove the legacy app-side
MCP tools bridge. Input validation and fixed embedded maze registrations remain.

